251697966130_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HF82htmbPagQ7kNvwFLbV1p&_nc_oc=Adov3qwDDNp4CmozAXHOn7UrxZErBJk-WeVS6AbGOPyfonnqximfdea3zVHi7vGhaUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3wcggmNFF_iprbiePuI0hhAuHsmRSQcg5pb7kpi7DM4w&oe=69F0A8DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HUHUHU.png", "id": "2035477956919467", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392314_2035477963586133_3759903070723388888_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fptqfDX95agQ7kNvwFZJUuK&_nc_oc=AdqX_AoaKvrIPSyU2sYG8YUEdRI5P9VuNJ76TQy4jY7kRkeLIZdaRJB5-G8IWS45WX4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0FLsSMEhKMo1QzIUYA5T-l88rttH_8e227rpu8_tukoA&oe=69F0B6A5"}, "display_name": "VITRIOL - DEMO", "keywords": ["Physics", "Fast", "Shooter", "Heavy", "Retro"], "long_description": "MARCH FOR YOUR GOD\n\nVITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality of VR through physics and retro coat of paint. \n\nFast and Loose - Long strides and Heavy Blows churn through the wretched horde with a freedom and ease VR is yet to experience.\n\nHand to Skull - Physics based Enemies and an in-depth elbow estimation system provide a physicality and presence to the combat which enhances gameplay beyond what was previously possible.\n\nBlood, Fire and Pillars of Smoke - Sinners malformed, The Righteous Risen. The Wrath of God in Iron Men. All this scored by a soundtrack that hits just as hard, drowned in a haze just as thick. ", "short_description": "MARCH FOR YOUR GOD\n\nVITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality of VR through physics and retro coat of paint. \n\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Lee Wilson", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/VitriolDev/Privacy-Policy/blob/main/VITRIOL%20DEMO%20Privacy%20Policy.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publi